{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメにも散々書いてるけど\n『勇者ヨシヒコと導かれし七人』\n始まったねえ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/09/2345854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日って最強過ぎない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金からの\n全力！脱力タイムズからの\nヨシヒコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな\nいい週末を迎えられそうだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/09/2345854/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい週末と言えば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木中です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例のタンバリンね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/09/2345854/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/10/09/2345854/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の今週末は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い物したり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとご飯行ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中高の友達とご飯行ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今は部屋の整理中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通すぎて何も広がらないし\n書くか迷うレベルだけど\n敢えて書きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな\n「これは普通すぎてつまらないやー」\nって思って書くのをやめるから\n意外と普通すぎる話は\n聞いたことないんじゃないかと思ったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}